# The embedded Roomcord web bundle is verified byte-for-byte against
# assets/roomcord/bundle-manifest.json at build time (checkRoomcordBundle).
# Git's CRLF normalisation (core.autocrlf=input) silently rewrites the few
# text files in it — NOTICES and the record_web helpers — which shrinks them
# by one byte per line and fails that check on a fresh checkout.
# Keep every packed byte exactly as the packing script produced it.
lemuroid-app/src/main/assets/roomcord/** -text
